tation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,88,57,64,66,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,88,57,64,66,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,88,57,64,66,81],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ1010502","city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":1,"stats":[79,88,57,64,66,81],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"百济第五代君主，盖娄王之子。肖古王即位之初，其父盖娄王庇护邻国新罗的叛国者吉宣，因而与新罗连年征战不休，之间皆有胜负。肖古王在位期间，百济正处于从部落联盟向早期国家过渡的关键阶段。汉末同期，肖古王再次攻打新罗，夺回数座城池。三国鼎立前期，肖古王又率一千勇士攻下石门城，不久后，便遭到了扶余靺鞨骑兵反攻，最终肖古王奋战至死。","tc":"百濟第五代君主，蓋婁王之子。肖古王即位之初，其父蓋婁王庇護鄰國新羅的叛國者吉宣，因而與新羅連年征戰不休，之間皆有勝負。肖古王在位期間，百濟正處于從部落聯盟向早期國家過渡的關鍵階段。漢末同期，肖古王再次攻打新羅，奪回數座城池。三國鼎立前期，肖古王又率一千勇士攻下石門城，不久后，便遭到了扶余靺鞨騎兵反攻，最終肖古王奮戰至死。","en":"The fifth ruler of Baekje and son of King Gaeru. At the beginning of King Chogo's reign, because his father King Gaeru had harbored the Silla defector Gil Seon, war raged with Silla for years on end, with both sides trading victories. During his reign, Baekje was transitioning from a tribal confederation to an early state. Around the end of the Han dynasty, King Chogo attacked Silla again and recaptured several cities. In the early period of the Three Kingdoms tripartite division, he led a thousand warriors to capture Seongmun Fortress. Not long after, however, he faced a Buyeo-Mohe cavalry counterattack and ultimately fought to the death.","jp":"百済第5代君主。蓋婁王の子。肖古王の即位当初、父である蓋婁王が隣国・新羅の反逆者である吉宣を庇護したため、新羅と連年にわたり戦火を交え、互いに勝敗を繰り返した。肖古王の在位中、百済は部族連盟から初期国家へと移行する重要な過渡期にあった。漢末の同時期、肖古王は再び新羅を攻め、数城を奪還した。三国鼎立の前期には、さらに千人の勇士を率いて石門城を攻略したが、間もなく扶余・靺鞨の騎兵による反撃に遭い、最期は肖古王自ら奮戦の末に命を落とした。","kr":"백제의 제5대 군주이자 개루왕의 아들이다. 초고왕 즉위 초, 선왕인 개루왕이 이웃 나라 신라의 반역자 길선을 비호한 일로 인해 신라와 연이어 전쟁을 치르며 승패를 거듭했다. 초고왕 재위 기간에 백제는 부족 연맹에서 초기 국가로 전환하는 중요한 과도기를 거치고 있었다. 후한 말엽, 초고왕은 다시 신라를 공격하여 여러 성을 탈환했다. 삼국 정립 전기에는 또다시 용사 1천 명을 이끌고 석문성을 함락시켰으나, 얼마 지나지 않아 부여와 말갈 기병의 반격을 받아 끝내 분전하다 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1010502","remark":"","surname":"肖","surnameTc":"肖","surnameEn":"Xiao","surnameJp":"肖","surnameKr":"초","surnameOther":"","name":"古","nameTc":"古","nameEn":"Gu","nameJp":"古","nameKr":"고","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"肖古","power":"WJ1010502","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"166","city":"CS1068","gender":"0","rule":"79","force":"88","wise":"57","politics":"64","charm":"66","will":"81","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"13","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"31/31/87/31/31/16/50/31","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1002402;1011302","battleSkill":"100270